            </style></head><body><div xmlns="" class="page-wrapper"><h2 class="auth__title">График отпусков</h2><div class="doc-snippet">   Когда понадобится: для составления графика отпусков.  </div><div class="page-box" id="doc-box"><div class="doc-page"><div id="documentConftent" class="content content-form"><div align="null"><table width="100%"><tbody><tr><td><p><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr1/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfasblnx3s/" data-dfa="dfasblnx3s"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfasauu2ip/" data-dfa="dfasauu2ip"></a>&nbsp;Согласовано&nbsp;</p></td><td><p style="text-align:right"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr2/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfaswwffig/" data-dfa="dfaswwffig"></a>Утверждаю</p></td></tr><tr><td><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr3/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfas4dtrgi/" data-dfa="dfas4dtrgi"></a>Председатель профсоюзного органа</td><td style="text-align: right;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr4/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfaszwehgf/" data-dfa="dfaszwehgf"></a>Руководитель предприятия</td></tr><tr><td><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr5/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfasahvdse/" data-dfa="dfasahvdse"></a>Подпись_________________</td><td style="text-align: right;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr6/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfasgoi5mw/" data-dfa="dfasgoi5mw"></a>Подпись________________________</td></tr><tr><td><p><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr7/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfasmr5opz/" data-dfa="dfasmr5opz"></a>30 декабря 2025&nbsp;года</span></p></td><td style="text-align: right;"><p><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr8/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfastmh1q1/" data-dfa="dfastmh1q1"></a>30 декабря 2025&nbsp;года</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr9/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfasr66ia6/" data-dfa="dfasr66ia6"></a>ГРАФИК ОТПУСКОВ<br><span id="sfwc_1" class="sfwc"></span><span class="tooltip__wrapper"><span class="tooltip__point no-print"></span><span class="tooltip_text no-print"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfasn2qwzi/" data-dfa="dfasn2qwzi"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr10/"></a>График отпусков составляйте по той форме, которую утверждает руководитель в учетной политике.<br><br><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr11/"></a>Ознакомьте с графиком всех работников. Чтобы избежать возможных претензий, попросите сотрудника поставить подпись напротив даты его предполагаемого отпуска в поле «Примечание» графика. Либо приложите к графику отпусков ознакомительный лист, в котором каждый работник укажет дату ознакомления и поставит подпись.</span></span></p><div align="null"><table width="100%"><tbody><tr><td class="bdAll" rowspan="3" style="text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr12/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfasbo344e/" data-dfa="dfasbo344e"></a><strong>Структурное<br>подразделение</strong></td><td class="bdAll" rowspan="3"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr13/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfasycei8s/" data-dfa="dfasycei8s"></a><strong>Должность по<br>штатному<br>расписанию</strong></p></td><td class="bdAll" rowspan="3" style="text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr14/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfasmmc1q2/" data-dfa="dfasmmc1q2"></a><strong>ФИО</strong></td><td class="bdAll" rowspan="3"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr15/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfaskouueq/" data-dfa="dfaskouueq"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfass6hqpg/" data-dfa="dfass6hqpg"></a><strong>Таб.</strong><br><strong>номер</strong></p></td><td class="bdAll" colspan="5" style="text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr16/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfas4sdoh4/" data-dfa="dfas4sdoh4"></a><strong>Отпуск</strong></td><td class="bdAll" rowspan="3" style="text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr17/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfasdhwkfe/" data-dfa="dfasdhwkfe"></a><strong>Примечание</strong></td></tr><tr><td class="bdAll" rowspan="2"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr18/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfaskn7wuz/" data-dfa="dfaskn7wuz"></a><strong>Кол-во<br>календарных&nbsp;<br>дней&nbsp;</strong></p></td><td class="bdAll" colspan="2" style="text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr19/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfaskppvpe/" data-dfa="dfaskppvpe"></a><strong>Дата</strong></td><td class="bdAll" colspan="2" style="text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr20/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfasnac6s3/" data-dfa="dfasnac6s3"></a><strong>Перенос отпуска</strong></td></tr><tr><td class="bdAll"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr21/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfasfg5wy3/" data-dfa="dfasfg5wy3"></a><strong>По плану</strong>&nbsp;</p></td><td class="bdAll" style="text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr22/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfaslol4e3/" data-dfa="dfaslol4e3"></a><strong>Фактическая</strong></td><td class="bdAll" style="text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr23/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfas1wng1g/" data-dfa="dfas1wng1g"></a><strong>Основание</strong></td><td class="bdAll" style="text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr24/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfastoktgp/" data-dfa="dfastoktgp"></a><strong>Дата предполагаемого<br>отпуска</strong></td></tr><tr><td class="bdAll" style="text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr25/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfas82092w/" data-dfa="dfas82092w"></a><strong>1</strong></td><td class="bdAll" style="text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr26/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfas2c0nkg/" data-dfa="dfas2c0nkg"></a><strong>2</strong></td><td class="bdAll" style="text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr27/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfasshvmdq/" data-dfa="dfasshvmdq"></a><strong>3</strong></td><td class="bdAll" style="text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr28/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfas0emvg2/" data-dfa="dfas0emvg2"></a><strong>4</strong></td><td class="bdAll" style="text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr29/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfassv60n8/" data-dfa="dfassv60n8"></a><strong>5</strong></td><td class="bdAll" style="text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr30/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfasydp7ho/" data-dfa="dfasydp7ho"></a><strong>6</strong></td><td class="bdAll" style="text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr31/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfasrhcgs1/" data-dfa="dfasrhcgs1"></a><strong>7</strong></td><td class="bdAll" style="text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr32/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfashxiu5g/" data-dfa="dfashxiu5g"></a><strong>8</strong></td><td class="bdAll" style="text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr33/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfasr6zq7a/" data-dfa="dfasr6zq7a"></a><strong>9</strong></td><td class="bdAll" style="text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr34/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfasbt2ire/" data-dfa="dfasbt2ire"></a><strong>10</strong></td></tr><tr><td class="bdAll"><p><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr35/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfasnthi72/" data-dfa="dfasnthi72"></a>Отдел продаж</span></p></td><td class="bdTopbdBottombdRight"><p><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr36/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfastan05z/" data-dfa="dfastan05z"></a>Ведущий специалист</span></p></td><td class="bdTopbdBottombdRight"><p><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr37/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfaskgxksn/" data-dfa="dfaskgxksn"></a>Асроров Абдулла Таджиметович</span></p></td><td class="bdTopbdBottombdRight"><p><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr38/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfaswi7v22/" data-dfa="dfaswi7v22"></a>10</span></p></td><td class="bdTopbdBottombdRight"><p><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr39/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfasglkaya/" data-dfa="dfasglkaya"></a>24</span></p></td><td class="bdTopbdBottombdRight"><p><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr40/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfasmab5sm/" data-dfa="dfasmab5sm"></a>07.09.2026</span></p></td><td class="bdTopbdBottombdRight"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfasv7koc1/" data-dfa="dfasv7koc1"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr41/"></a>&nbsp;</td><td class="bdTopbdBottombdRight"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfasm35e08/" data-dfa="dfasm35e08"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr42/"></a>&nbsp;</td><td class="bdTopbdBottombdRight"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfaskmnqrx/" data-dfa="dfaskmnqrx"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr43/"></a>&nbsp;</td><td class="bdTopbdBottombdRight"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfas3kw711/" data-dfa="dfas3kw711"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr44/"></a>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td class="bdBottombdRightbdLeft"><p><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr45/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfash78gzs/" data-dfa="dfash78gzs"></a>Бухгалтерия</span></p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight"><p><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr46/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfasabv2q2/" data-dfa="dfasabv2q2"></a>Материальный бухгалтер</span></p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight"><p><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr47/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfassrazs7/" data-dfa="dfassrazs7"></a>Аскарова Дильдора Рустамовна</span></p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight"><p><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr48/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfasnsynvz/" data-dfa="dfasnsynvz"></a>8</span></p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight"><p><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr49/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfas7246dk/" data-dfa="dfas7246dk"></a>24</span></p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight"><p><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr50/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfas0heugm/" data-dfa="dfas0heugm"></a>08.08.2026</span></p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight"><p><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfasy309ly/" data-dfa="dfasy309ly"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr51/"></a>19.06.2026</span></p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight"><p><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr52/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfas8mbaq1/" data-dfa="dfas8mbaq1"></a>приказ 15 от 20.06.2026</span></p></td><td class="bdBottombdRight"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfasqfi8hy/" data-dfa="dfasqfi8hy"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr53/"></a>&nbsp;</td><td class="bdBottombdRight"><p><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr54/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfas3owh57/" data-dfa="dfas3owh57"></a>выездная проверка ГНИ</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div align="null"><table width="100%"><tbody><tr><td colspan="2" style="vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfas25t3vk/" data-dfa="dfas25t3vk"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr55/"></a>Руководитель кадровой службы<span id="sfwc_2" class="sfwc"></span><span class="tooltip__wrapper"><span class="tooltip__point no-print"></span><span class="tooltip_text no-print"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfas4gnrn8/" data-dfa="dfas4gnrn8"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr56/"></a>График отпусков оформляют сотрудники отдела кадров.<br><br><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr57/"></a>Если отдела кадров нет, то график составляет тот сотрудник, на которого возложены обязанности ведения кадрового учета. Составляют документ на каждый календарный год. Причем подготовить его нужно до начала года. Например, график отпусков на 2024&nbsp;год подготовьте уже в декабре 2023&nbsp;года.</span></span></td><td class="bdBottom" style="vertical-align: top; width: 280px; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr58/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfasrp8t7b/" data-dfa="dfasrp8t7b"></a>&nbsp;</td><td style="vertical-align: top; text-align: center;"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr59/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfasdi5v83/" data-dfa="dfasdi5v83"></a>А.П. Мананов&nbsp;</span></td></tr><tr><td colspan="3" style="vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr60/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfas7hyfl4/" data-dfa="dfas7hyfl4"></a>Руководители структурных подразделений:</td><td style="vertical-align: top;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr61/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfas30uk94/" data-dfa="dfas30uk94"></a>&nbsp;</td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align: top;"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr62/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfasl3gs9x/" data-dfa="dfasl3gs9x"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfasggo1as/" data-dfa="dfasggo1as"></a>Начальник отдела продаж</span>&nbsp;</td><td class="bdBottom" colspan="2" style="vertical-align: top; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr63/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfas1m0tts/" data-dfa="dfas1m0tts"></a>&nbsp;</td><td style="vertical-align: top; text-align: center;"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr64/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfasz3zgq9/" data-dfa="dfasz3zgq9"></a>Б. Гулямов&nbsp;</span></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align: top;"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr65/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfasahylff/" data-dfa="dfasahylff"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfasdkmr6s/" data-dfa="dfasdkmr6s"></a>Главный бухгалтер</span>&nbsp;</td><td class="bdTopbdBottom" colspan="2" style="vertical-align: top; text-align: center;"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr66/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfastxk8pg/" data-dfa="dfastxk8pg"></a>&nbsp;</td><td style="vertical-align: top; text-align: center;"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/bssPhr67/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/204276/dfast43bg5/" data-dfa="dfast43bg5"></a>Р.П. Саидова</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="footer">© Материал из ЭС "ACTION: Главбух"<br />https://1gb.uz<br />Дата копирования: 29.09.2026</div></div></div></div></body></html>